{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id941977585"}, "name":{"label":"1725382"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-11-07T11:13:36-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2025.11"}, "id":{"label":"13368996987"}, "title":{"label":"The best podcast player available"}, "content":{"label":"I have been using Overcast for about 4 years now, hands down the best player I have used.  when I switched back to an iPhone I tried many others and none of them did what I wanted.  I love how customizable the play lists are.  I have 2 one for my ride to work and a general one.  Everything downloads automatically.  Monday morning i just hit play.  The best part is the app keeps getting better.  Did I mention it’s made by a single developer.  Amazing job Marco", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
