{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id194673940"}, "name":{"label":"Jozh45"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-10-21T00:52:41-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2025.11"}, "id":{"label":"13294273605"}, "title":{"label":"Getting better all the time"}, "content":{"label":"If you tried the app after the redesign and were disappointed by the sluggishness (I know I was!), I recommend you give it another try.\n\nMarco has been hard at work, he’s more communicative now and has been posting and discussing updates on Reddit. He has honestly convinced me that he’s not giving up on the app, Overcast is in a better place now, I’m looking forward to the day we finally get Chapter Selection, which hopefully won’t be too far from now.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
